  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 247 ÷ 13 + 16 × 3 − 148 = 119\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nOption 1): + and ×\n\n247 ÷ 13 + 16 × 3 − 148 = 119 ⇒ 247 ÷ 13 × 16 + 3 − 148 = 119\n\n⇒ __**247 ÷ 13**__ × 16 + 3 − 148 = 119\n\n⇒ __**19 × 16**__ + 3 − 148 = 119\n\n⇒ __**304 + 3**__ − 148 = 119\n\n⇒ __307____** − 148**__ = 119\n\n⇒ 159 ≠ 119 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2): − and +\n\n247 ÷ 13 + 16 × 3 − 148 = 119 ⇒ 247 ÷ 13 - 16 × 3 + 148 = 119\n\n⇒ __**247 ÷ 13**__ - 16 × 3 + 148 = 119\n\n⇒ 19 - __**16 × 3**__ + 148 = 119\n\n⇒ __**19 + 148**__ - 48 = 119\n\n⇒ __167** - 48**__ = 119\n\n⇒ 119 = 119 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 3): − and ×\n\n247 ÷ 13 + 16 × 3 − 148 = 119 ⇒ 247 ÷ 13 + 16 - 3 × 148 = 119\n\n⇒ __**247 ÷ 13**__ + 16 - 3 × 148 = 119\n\n⇒ 19 + 16 - __**3 **____**×**____** 148**__ = 119\n\n⇒ __**19 + 16**__ - 444 = 119\n\n⇒ __**35 - 444**__ = 119\n\n⇒ -409 ≠ 119 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4): ÷ and ×\n\n247 ÷ 13 + 16 × 3 − 148 = 119 ⇒ 247 × 13 + 16 ÷ 3 − 148 = 119\n\n⇒ 247 × 13 + __**16 **____**÷**____** 3**__ − 148 = 119\n\n⇒ __**247 ×**____** 13**__ + 5.33 − 148 = 119\n\n⇒ __**3211**____** + 5.3**____**3**__ − 148 = 119\n\n⇒ __3216____.3____3** − 148**__ = 119\n\n⇒ 3068.33 ≠ 119 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
